{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>For a nation lost of counsel.</b> The correct view is that this nation is the enemies of Israel, and the word אבד is an adjective and is in construct state, therefore the bet has a dagesh. It is known that the word אבד is from the intransitive verbs; only the sense of עצות reverts to אבד, like נובלת עליה, and likewise ותאבדו דרך, which is in construct to דרך. Now the translator understood, for he said: מאבדי עצה."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:05.107492852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}